  "content": "[Intro]\n[D#]\n[Gm]\nIt's a\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D#]crime, you let it happ-\nen to me Never\n[Gm]mind, I let it happ-\nen to you I don't\n[Cm]mind, forget it, there's no-\nthing to lose But my\n[C#5]mind and all the things\nI wanted Every\n[E]time I get it, I\nthrow it away It's a\n[G#m]sign, I get it, I\nwant to stay By the\n[C#m]time I lose it, I'm\nnot afraid I'm a-\n[D]live but I can sure-\nly fake it\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]How can I believe,\nwhen this\n[G#m]cloud hangs over me?\nYou're the\n[C#m]part of me that I\n[A5]don't want [B5]to see\n[E]Forget it\n[G#m]\n[C#m]\n[A5]  [B5]\n[A5]\nThere's a\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]place I see you fol-\nlow me Just a\n[Am]taste of all that might\ncome to be I'm a-\n[D5]lone, but holding breath\nyou can breathe To\n[D#5]question every an-\nswer counted\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#]Just\nfade a-\n[A#m]way\nPlease let me\n[D#5]stay\nCaught in your\n[Bsus2]way\n[F#]Just\nfade a-\n[A#m]way\nPlease let me\n[D#5]stay\nCaught in your\n[Bsus2]way\nIt's a\n\n[Verse 3]\n[G]crime, you let it happ-\nen to me I don't\n[Bm]mind, I love it, ea-\nsy to please Never-\n[E5]mind, forget it, just\nmemories On a\n[F5]page inside a spi-\nral notebook\n\n[Interlude]\n[G#]\n[Cm]\n[F5]\n[C#5]\n\n[Chorus-Outro]\n[G#]Just\nfade a-\n[Cm]way\nPlease let me\n[F5]stay\nCaught in your\n[C#5]way\n[G#]Just\nfade a-\n[Cm]way\nPlease let me\n[F5]stay\nCaught in your\n[C#5]way\n[G#]How can I believe,\nwhen this\n[Cm]cloud hangs over me?\nYou're the\n[F5]part of me that I\ndon't want to see\n[C#5]I can\nlive forever here\n[G#]",
